          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Elisha yaava e Yeriko, yaaja e Betheli. Bwe yali ng'ali kutambula mu ngira, abaisuka abatobato baava mu kibuga, baamuyeeyereza nga bakoba bati: “Va agho oje, iwe kapaata! Va agho oje, iwe kapaata!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha yaakyuka, yaalinga einhuma yaababona, era yaabakolimira mu liina lya Musengwa Katonda. Agho ebisolo ebikambwe bibiri ebikazi byava mu kibira, byayuzayuza abaana amakumi ana n'ababiri (42) ku abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
